{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225560","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225560","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222556001:0":{"text":"넓고 시야가 탁 트인 곳이네요. 하라크를 유인하기 좋은 곳이에요!","source_cn":"这地方相对空旷，视野也好。感觉是诱哈拉克上钩的好地方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9776BA47356C64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222556002:0":{"text":"좋아요, 좋아. 이제 제 차례군요.","source_cn":"很好很好，这时候就轮到我登场了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E6773D995731DF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222556003:0":{"text":"자, 용감한 영웅분들! 그럼 누가 제일 먼저 마음을 보여줄 건가요?","source_cn":"好了，勇敢的英雄们！展出的舞台已经备好，谁身先士卒展现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53362F836040659C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222556004:0":{"text":"치피, 치피가 먼저 할게요! 치피는 숨길 게 없거든요!","source_cn":"满满，让满满来吧，满满没什么要隐瞒的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5767EE7C911F2C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222556005:0":{"text":"저도요. 하라크를 물리치기 위해 제 마음속 소원을 보여 드릴게요.","source_cn":"我也是。为了击败哈拉克，我愿意展示心中的愿望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A6637193C49BEA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222556006:1":{"text":"그...럼! 눈을 감아요. 제가 요정의 마법을 선보이죠!","source_cn":"那——么，闭上眼睛，让我来施展妖精的魔法吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5728401CA756F122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1222557001:":{"text":"햄스터 기사단, 도열!","source_cn":"仓鼠骑士团，列队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF326DA063FBC39E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1222557002:":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 보세요!","source_cn":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，看！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC0FD336FFA6326DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 보세요!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 보세요!","variant_male_record_index":"138608","variant_female_record_index":"138609","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1222557003:":{"text":"아얏...!","source_cn":"哎——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF605B175D335E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:12:1222557004:":{"text":"하하, 해미 정말 대단한걸?","source_cn":"漫漫真厉害","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7D7E0B0F8C2802","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하하, 해미 정말 대단한걸?","female":"하하, 해미 